@startuml Token Refresh
title Refreshing Expired Access Token

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB

User -> App: Use app (access token expired)
App -> App: Detect access token expired
App -> API: POST /api/auth/refresh\n{refresh_token}
API -> DB: Validate refresh token
DB -> API: Token valid, return user
API -> API: Check token expiration date
API -> API: Generate new access token
API -> App: Return {access_token, refresh_token}
App -> App: Update stored access token
App -> App: Retry original request with new token

@enduml
